      "title": "Effect to advance pricing agreement.",
      "x": 27.62,
      "y_start": 80.59,
      "page_start": 1,
      "page_end": 1,
      "text_before_subsections": "23[(1) Irrespective of anything to the contrary contained in section 263, where an income is modified as a result of advance pricing agreement entered into with any person then, such person shall, or any other person being an associated enterprise may,—",
      "subsections": [
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "2",
          "id": "169-2",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "Except as provided in this section, all other provisions of this Act shall apply accordingly as if the modified return is a return furnished under section 263.",
          "clauses": [],
          "text_after_clauses": "",
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-169-2-001",
              "target_id": "263",
              "target_type": "section",
              "anchor_text": "section 263",
              "relationship": "depends_on",
              "confidence": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "3",
          "id": "169-3",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "Where a modified return is furnished under sub-section (1), and assessment or reassessment proceedings, in respect of a tax year to which the agreement applies, were initiated before the filing of such return then,—",
          "clauses": [
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "a",
              "id": "169-3-a",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 395.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "if such proceedings have been completed before the filing of such return, the Assessing Officer shall pass an order modifying the total income of the relevant tax year; or",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "b",
              "id": "169-3-b",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 415.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "if such proceedings are pending on the date of filing of modified return, the Assessing Officer shall proceed to complete them, as per the agreement after taking into consideration the modified return so furnished.",
              "children": []
            }
          ],
          "text_after_clauses": "",
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-169-3-001",
              "target_id": "169-1",
              "target_type": "subsection",
              "anchor_text": "sub-section (1)",
              "relationship": "depends_on",
              "confidence": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "4",
          "id": "169-4",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "Irrespective of anything contained in section 275 or 286 or 296,—",
          "clauses": [
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "a",
              "id": "169-4-a",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 395.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "the order in respect of a case falling under sub-section (3)(a) shall be passed within one year from the end of the financial year in which the modified return under sub-section (1) is furnished;",
              "children": [],
              "references": [
                {
                  "reference_id": "ref-169-4-a-001",
                  "target_id": "169-3-a",
                  "target_type": "clause",
